<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Nafilimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa Nafilimoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nafilimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Naf</para>
  <para style="mt2">Iwarakha i Napaolo wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nafilimoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha ikani ya Nafilimoni yaalhepiye ni akarumiya Napaolo (nlhako wo 1:1). Ikatema yaalhepa aya, Napaolo yaari muuttukiyani, yoonihaka wiira veekinaka yaari Urumi. Paahi etu yakhalhaka yaari Urumi yeyo ikatema iyo, iyaakha yaalhempe aya yaari yo 61 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo, ikatema yeyo yeyo yaalhempe aya yo iwarakha wa attu o Ukolosai. Yaalhempe ilha iwarakha ilha wa ntu eehaniya Filimoni, aari mmoka munlhokoni mwa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo aashunga attu ipotta. Napaolo yaalhempe wo nnikwa wo waalhepelha wiira ahintwarushe ipotta aya, Onesimo, aattawilhe ukhuma wa Nafilimoni. Wo malhehero e Irumi khalhayi vawo, Nafilimoni ahanaa ikuru yo unhukumulha Onesimo wiiviya. Napaolo anoolhumacha wo waapepecha ni waavaha nrima Nafilimoni wiira ahimpangelhe ittu yo uhilhoka vamoka ni munnihu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Timotheo, kinoolhepa iwarakha iwe uwaninyu alhoko aka ni namitheko a Kuristo Yesu nkhunanihu Filimoni, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />ni wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristoanokumaana unupani winyu ni arokorihu Naapiya ni wa Naakipo namitheko nanihu o waatakanelha Malhove Orera.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Kinoulhapelhelhani nnema ni mpuha ukhuma wa Nlhuku Athumwanihu ni Athithi Yesu Kuristo.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uttuna ni upisha nrima u Nafilimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Kinonshukuru Nlhuku kila ikatema vanolhapelha aka ni uwupuwelhani inyu Nafilimoni, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />ukhalhawaya kinowiiwa nrima urina inyu wo waarumelhelha Athithi Yesu ni nrima wo waattuna attu a Nlhuku. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Kinonlhapelha Nlhuku wiira nthepeke upisha nrima inyu, mwoorie uchuwelha chinene kila ibarakha irina ihu wo ukhalha nlhoko mmoka ni Kuristo. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Munna, uttuna winyu uhokiteelhiha ni ukihelha nrima chinene. Ukhalhawaya nhoteelhiha mirima cha attu a Nlhuku.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napaolo anowalhepelha Nafilimoni ampochere Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, mii kikhalhaka munninyu wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo, kaanooria uukhanyererihani wo uhoova ittu ilheheriye inyu upanga, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />nansho wo nlhatu wo uttunani, kinoulhepelhani. Kineera chiicho inakhalhaka mii Paolo ki ntu owulhuvalha, kittukiye wo nlhatu wo uvara ntheko wa Yesu Kuristo. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Paahi, kinoulhepelhani wiira munkaviheke mwaamwanaka Onesimo, aari mwaamwanaka wo ulhutaana ni Kuristo, kikhalhaka thoko athumwanawe vaari ihu mu uttukiyani. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Khalhayi vawo aari ntu o uhikhulhuvelhiya uwaninyu, nansho wo ikekhiaye vano phi o ukhulhuvelhiya kuhii uwannyaka vekha ayaru nansho ni uwaninyu chiicho.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Vano etu kinonhokolhosha tho uwaninyu waakhumme awe, ukhalhawaya vano yoyo ri thoko nrima aka. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Kahothanana wiira athepe ukhalha ni mii uttukiye aka uno, akikaviheke mitheko cho uhimiacha Malhove Orera thoko chikenre inyu munna. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Nansho akinookhanyererihani wiira nkikavihe uhuva waka. Urera nrima winyu ukhalheke wo uttuna winyu mwaanene.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Veekinaka phi nlhatu etu Onesimo aari utayi ni inyu wo mahuku vakani, wiira ahokolhiaka awe okhalhanani wowo mahuku onkhaye. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Ulha vano kahiwe ipotta tho, nansho o upwaha ipotta, vano ulha mpwana ihu. Hokiteelhiha nrima mii ni we ikekhiaye noowa uuteelhihani nrima ni inyu thoko ntu ri ipotta ni nlhoko ihu muulhutaanani ni Athithi.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Vano etu mwachuwelhaka wiira mii ki nkavihi nkhunaninyu mu ulhutaanani ni Athithi, mumpochereke etu thoko chikenre inyu wo ukipochera mii. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Yakhalhaka ahoupangelhani ittu yo uhilhoka ama ahowaashimani ittu, mii kinoulhivani. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Vaa, mii Paolo kinolhepa wo moono aka kimwanene, kinoulhivani. Nansho akinowuupushani wiira ni mii nkilhiveke ukumi inyu. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Paahi etu munna, kinoulhepelhani wiira nkipangelheke nenno nlhove nno wo nlhatu wa Athithi, nkiteelhiheke nrima thoko munninyu mu uttunanani nhina Kuristo.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Ukhalhawaya kinoukhulhuvelhani, paahi etu vanolhepa aka ilha iwarakha ilha, kihochuwelha wiira nnoopanga chilhepenlhe aka uwaninyu chiyo, tho nnoopanga wo uthepa. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Nansho vamoka ni yayo malhove ayo, nkaaverieke inupa yo uphiyelha, ukhalhawaya kiri muukhulhuvelhani wiira Nlhuku noopochera ulhapelha winyu mwaatti onkhaye ni mii kinoowa kooweetelhelhani wowo uwaninyu uwo.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isalamu cho umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafra ttukiye nkhunanaka wo nlhatu wo uvara ntheko wa Kuristo Yesu, nouvahani isalamu. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Chiicho anamitheko nanaka Namako ni Naaristako ni Nadema ni ashinna Luka ni ayo anouvahani isalamu.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Nnema wa Athithi Yesu Kuristo ukhalheke vamoka ni nrima inyu mwaatti onkhaye.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>